        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-09T17:56:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That ruling is covered by the FAQ, in the Timing section, where it mentions that if an effect is happening and then something occurs which removes the card the effect is from, then the rest of the effect doesn't happen.&nbsp; It's just not called out specifically for Psi Weaver or any single card.</p>",
