        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-09T20:25:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>An example of when this kind of thing is very useful - Expatriette and Ra versus Gloomweaver. Expatriette had out Hairtrigger Reflexes. Ra had Flame Barrier. There was a +1 damage buff in play - I think we were Galvanised by Legacy. Ra probably had his Staff out too, but I can't remember now. So, Gloomy plays a Cultist, who gets instantly shot for two points of damage. The Cultist attacks us, hitting Ra first. Ra's Flame Barrier goes off and finishes off the Cultist, who comes back as a Zombie...which gets insta-killed by Expatriette. Okay so Ra took more damage than anyone else during that game, but we never came anywhere near losing (hey, it was Gloomweaver, after all ;)). That was a very fun game! :D</p>",
